Join the millions of people who love the Life Bible App (formerly Tecarta Bible). Our mission is to help people get the most out of their Bibles every day. Start every morning with the verse of the day, daily devotional or daily TouchPoint - answers for life’s most important questions.

Whether you are a beginner or veteran, you can find everything you need to deepen your relationship with God and grow. Start your day inspired with over 36,000 devotionals. If you love what you read, you can easily purchase the devotional and read directly in the app. Choose from over 600 topics like faith, anxiety, spiritual growth, courage, marriage and more. 

Already know what you want to study? Choose from 100+ Study Bibles and Commentaries and get access to study resources like book introductions, personality profiles, maps, charts and more.  Need help understanding a verse or just simply want to know more? With just one tap, find the meaning behind every Bible verse (Explain) or see the verse in other Bible translations (Compare). Easily share with family and friends. 

TOP TRANSLATIONS and STUDY BIBLES
∙ English Translations: NLT, NIV, KJV, ESV, NKJV, NASB and many more;
∙ Study Bibles include LASB, NIV Study Bible, ESV Study Bible, NKJV Study Bible, NASB MacArthur and all the other top selling Study Bibles;
∙ Other languages include Spanish, Portuguese, Korean, French, Chinese and Tagalog.

FEATURES
∙ Designed by developers and designers who love the Bible;
∙ Stream popular translations for free. Download any title for offline access;
∙ Get daily Bible app notifications each morning for the verse of the day and daily devotional;
∙ Over 600 topics for your daily reading. Choose from some of our top reading plans: One-year Bible, The Bible Recap, Chronological Bible, Psalms, Proverbs, Old Testament, New Testament or create your own plan;
∙ Create free 3, 7, 14 or 30 day devotional plans.;
∙ Read and discuss a plan with family and friends using the Group Plan feature;
∙ Search over 40 translations simultaneously to find your Bible verse. Filter to select your favorite Bible translations;
∙ The only Bible app to have the best-selling TouchPoints series available for free. Discover over 350 topics with engaging questions and Scriptures to find Bible answers for life’s most important questions;
∙ Listen using our audio Bibles to study God’s Word on the go;
∙ Explore and try for free all the best-selling Study Bibles as well as top commentaries. Commentaries include Cornerstone Bible Commentary, Life Application Bible Commentary, Thru the Bible Commentary, Jon Courson’s Application Commentary, Believer’s Bible Commentary, Matthew Henry Concise Commentary and the Preacher’s Commentary.
∙ Choose your own unique highlight colors to markup important verses and insights in your Bible app;
∙ Create personal study notes with our “verse notes” feature;
∙ Flip seamlessly between your Bible and notes so you don’t get left behind during church. Rich text editor allows you to bold, underline, indent or create numbered and bulleted lists;
∙ Split the screen so you can see Bibles, Study Bibles, commentaries or personal notes side by side;
∙ Backup & sync your content. Access notes, bookmarks, highlights and purchases across all your mobile and web devices for easy access anywhere;
∙ Customize your settings to change font, font size, and light/dark mode;
∙ Share verses with family and friends via email, text, Twitter or Facebook.

Learn more at https://lifebible.com/features

OFFLINE photo translator and dictionary -- the ultimate foreign language tool when you are abroad! 
Translates sentences and photos without data connection between English, Chinese, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Turkish and Bulgarian in offline mode. A must have if you travel to foreign countries - save on data roaming charges!

Our unique translation technology often delivers translations that excel both Google Translate and Microsoft Translator while using much less storage space.
It also allows more language pairs than other paid apps having offline translation such as iTranslate.

FREE VERSION
- you will be reminded to support us by using one of our paid apps;
- you will be able to try 50 times the functionality of the full app (voice output and photo translation);

TRANSLATION
- translates from and to English, Chinese, Spanish, French, German, Italian, Turkish and Bulgarian;
- full-text translation without any internet connection;
- automatically detects input language;
- second language button (in the upper left corner) and swap languages button (in the top center of the screen) for easy swapping between the two languages.

PHOTO / PICTURE TRANSLATION AND OCR
- take a picture of printed text and translate it in seconds offline! 
- available for English, Chinese, German, French, Italian, Spanish, Turkish and Bulgarian;
- use this feature to easily convert photos of printed text into editable text in offline mode; 

VOICE / SPEECH
- voice / speech output for French, German, Italian, Spanish, English, Chinese, Bulgarian and Turkish*;
- allows reading individual words by tapping the desired word in the translation;

DICTIONARY
- dictionary between English, Chinese, Spanish, Turkish, German, French, Italian and Bulgarian;
- recognizes any word form and identifies its features (number, person, gender, etc.)
- displays all the translations for a given word;
- displayed for single words when hitting the Translate button;
- allows reading individual words by tapping the desired word in the translation;

You can test the app performance by getting the free version, Offline Translator 8 or online at http://offline-translator.com

If you encounter problems with the app, please contact our customer support at auser@skycode.com !

*Turkish is not supported on iOS 6.*

***** The unique application that writes beautiful acrostic poetry for you *****

Did you know that your iPhone can be a poet? Even your iPad can write beautiful poetry.

- Obtain in a flash a declaration of love in acrostic for the name of your choice;
- Millions of possible poems that follow themes and avoid repeating words;
- Poetry written by an author who has been specialised in acrostic for 15 years;
- Choose the poem's background picture among those proposed, or use one of your own;
- Easily share, send or print your poem;
- Write and send poems directly by message with the iMessage extension;
- Write a poem a day with the free version;
- For only $1.99, obtain unlimited poems and the possibility to sign your declaration;

Each verse begins with a letter of the name of the man or woman who you want to dedicate the poem to. You can choose a name, whatever its origin, or a nickname or even the terms of your choice, as long as they do not exceed 16 characters.
The application "Romance - The application to declare your love" writes, in an instant, for you, a pretty love poem that you can offer to the elect of your heart! Want another, on another topic? Your amazing device can compose a new one in a flash!
Beautifully presented, you can even edit it to personalise it even more, send poetry by email or save it to your photo gallery in order to print it from your computer or Airprint, or decorate a Facebook or Twitter post, or even send it by iMessage... It’s up to you to choose your sharing method among all that you have enabled on your mobile!
You can even write poems directly in an iMessage conversation thanks to the iMessage Romance extension included.
The Romance application already offers thousands of combinations, but the author does not stop there: he is committed to regularly adding new rhymes, new themes so that you can always have new and original poems, without even needing an internet connection.
Following advice given by the Apple team – application presented to Tim Cook himself! – Romance never stops being enhanced to give you absolutely unique functionalities.
A superb customised gift (Valentine’s Day, Christmas, birthday, wedding…) that you can make yourself (private use only)!
Romance is the application for love: the love of people, the love of words, the love of beautiful things and touching presents.
You are not convinced? Download Romance for free to put it to the test. The free version allows you to write up to one poem a day (and locked signature). If you want unlimited poems, you will only need to press BUY.
It will only cost you 1.99$/1.99£ and you Romance application will be unlocked. You will be able to use it, infinitely, to have all the poems you wish composed.

About the authors:
Logan Le Rudulier, who has been creating mobile games and applications since he was 13, develops the app itself. Great care has been given to Romance and your opinion on it will be received with pleasure.
Patrice Khal, poet specialised in acrostic for 15 years, writes the verses that harmoniously compose the declarations.
